BT /F1 9 Tf 54 611 Td (### 2.1 The Problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 585 Td (The global transition toward Post-Quantum Cryptography \(PQC\), formalized in NIST FIPS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 572 Td (  203/204/205 and OMB Memorandum M-26-15, mandates rapid modernization of cryptographic) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 559 Td (  systems. However, real-world deployment on edge systems faces three structural obstacles:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 533 Td (- **Algorithmic Rigidity:** Modern Linux services compile cryptographic algorithms directly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 520 Td (  into binary dependencies. When a PQC parameter set or mathematical assumption experiences) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 507 Td (  cryptanalytic degradation, systems cannot pivot dynamically without extensive) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 494 Td (  recompilation and downtime.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 481 Td (- **The TOCTOU Race Condition:** High-integrity edge nodes typically verify GPG/cosign) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 468 Td (  signatures against files stored on local disks. An unprivileged local attacker or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 455 Td (  container escape leveraging inotify or mount namespace manipulation can overwrite the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 442 Td (  executable file immediately after validation passes but before the `execve` syscall) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 429 Td (  executes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 416 Td (- **Proprietary Cloud EDR Centralization:** Commercial Endpoint Detection and Response) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 403 Td (  \(EDR\) solutions require persistent telemetry exfiltration to centralized corporate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 390 Td (  clouds, creating high subscription costs, privacy violations, and single points of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 377 Td (  failure that decentralized networks cannot tolerate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 351 Td (### 2.2 The Solution) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 325 Td (`pqc-immune-daemon` implements an autonomous, self-healing supervisor control plane that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 312 Td (  runs locally on the host:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 286 Td (1. **Continuous Inventory:** Periodically constructs a CycloneDX 1.6 Cryptographic Bill of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 273 Td (  Materials \(CBOM\) representing all active cryptographic assets, ciphersuites, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 260 Td (  parameter sets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 247 Td (2. **Declarative Evaluation:** Evaluates the CBOM against declarative Rego policies) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 234 Td (  compiled to WebAssembly. The default `fips_strict` profile allowlists NIST FIPS 203/204) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 221 Td (  algorithms and fails closed \(`recommended_fallback=NONE`\) on algorithm compromise. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 208 Td (  research `agility` profile enables supervised rollover to ISO/IEC 18033-2) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 195 Td (  `FrodoKEM-976-AES` via `fsync` + `os.replace` with POSIX signal notification \(`SIGHUP`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 182 Td (  *\(Legacy Frodo wire framing 0x02/0x03 was retired; production IPC utilizes native) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 169 Td (  ML-KEM-768 message framing\).*) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 156 Td (3. **Atomic Execution Sealing:** Verifies release payloads directly in anonymous memory) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 143 Td (  buffers \(`memfd_create`\), attaches cryptographic provenance attestations, seals the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 130 Td (  buffer against write modifications \(`F_SEAL_WRITE | F_SEAL_SEAL`\), and invokes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 117 Td (  `fexecve\(fd\)`.) Tj ET
